      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> three times per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The remnant of Barzillai is within Ravounel.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The remnant of Barzillai stirs up and amplifies unsettled spirits in the area to create a single haunt of 6th level or lower at his present location. This haunt is permanent until it is disabled or the remnant of Barzillai is destroyed.</p>",
